{"seq":23,"slug":"knowledge-graphs","title":"知识图谱","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":4,"docCount":18,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs","rating":{"composite":3.99,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.43,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"知识图谱-简介\">知识图谱 简介</h1><p>知识图谱以「实体—关系—实体」三元组的图结构组织知识，把零散事实变成机器可查询、可推理的结构化知识库。它是搜索引擎知识面板、智能问答、风控与推荐系统背后的共性基础设施。本知识库覆盖知识图谱从<strong>理论表示 → 自动构建 → 推理补全 → 落地应用</strong>的完整链路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>知识图谱与 AI 领域多个方向深度交叉。读者容易混淆「该去哪个 hub」，下表划清边界：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>本 hub（知识图谱）负责</th>\n<th>应去的兄弟 hub</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实体/关系抽取</td>\n<td>面向<strong>入图</strong>的抽取与融合流水线</td>\n<td><a href=\"../natural-language-processing/\">自然语言处理</a> 讲 NER/关系抽取的通用模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表示与嵌入</td>\n<td>KG <strong>专属</strong>嵌入（TransE/RotatE/ComplEx）、链接预测</td>\n<td><a href=\"../rag-knowledge-systems/\">RAG 知识系统</a> 讲文本向量与检索嵌入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图结构学习</td>\n<td>把 GNN <strong>用于</strong> KG 推理（R-GCN/CompGCN）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../graph-neural-networks/\">图神经网络</a> 讲 GNN 本身的架构与训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>符号+神经推理</td>\n<td>KG 上的规则挖掘与神经符号推理<strong>应用</strong></td>\n<td><a href=\"../neuro-symbolic-ai/\">神经符号 AI</a> 讲融合范式的一般理论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>问答</td>\n<td>基于<strong>结构化图谱</strong>的 KGQA</td>\n<td><a href=\"../natural-language-processing/\">自然语言处理</a> 讲文本阅读理解式 QA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索/推荐</td>\n<td>KG <strong>如何增强</strong>搜索与推荐</td>\n<td><a href=\"../ai-search-retrieval/\">搜索与检索</a>、<a href=\"../ai-recommendation-systems/\">推荐系统</a> 讲两者的主体技术栈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与 LLM 结合</td>\n<td>GraphRAG、KG 抑制幻觉、LLM+KG 推理</td>\n<td><a href=\"../rag-knowledge-systems/\">RAG 知识系统</a> 讲通用检索增强生成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：<strong>本 hub 始终以&quot;图谱&quot;为主角</strong>，凡是讲&quot;图谱如何被构建、推理、用于下游&quot;的内容归这里；下游技术（NLP 模型、向量检索、GNN 架构、推荐排序）的主体讲解归对应兄弟 hub，本 hub 只做交叉引用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>必备：图论基本概念（节点/边/路径）、Python 工程基础、线性代数（向量/矩阵运算）。</li>\n<li>推荐：了解深度学习与词嵌入（见 <a href=\"../natural-language-processing/nlp-foundations/word-representations\">自然语言处理 · 词表示</a>），便于理解第三章的图嵌入。</li>\n<li>构建章节涉及序列标注/关系分类，提前读 <a href=\"../natural-language-processing/text-understanding/named-entity-recognition\">NLP · 命名实体识别</a> 会更顺。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径-分人群\">推荐学习路径（分人群）</h2><p><strong>知识工程/数据工程师（构建优先）</strong>\n第一章基础 → 第二章构建（实体抽取 → 关系抽取 → 知识融合）→ 第四章「领域知识图谱实践」。目标是搭起一个可运行、可持续更新的图谱。</p>\n<p><strong>算法/推理研究者（推理优先）</strong>\n第一章「知识表示」→ 第三章全章（图嵌入 → KG 嵌入 → 规则推理 → 神经推理 → 神经符号）。可跳过构建章节细节，重点对比各推理范式的表达力与可解释性权衡。</p>\n<p><strong>LLM/应用工程师（落地优先）</strong>\n第一章「基本概念」速览 → 第四章应用全章（增强搜索、增强 LLM/GraphRAG、KGQA、推荐）。需要补嵌入背景时按需回看第三章前两节。</p>\n<p><strong>系统化入门者</strong>：按章节顺序通读 1→2→3→4，每章先读 <code>_INTRODUCTION.md</code> 再进叶子文档；每篇文末「延伸阅读与跨学科链接」指向兄弟 hub，遇到下游技术想深入时顺链跳转。</p>\n<h2 id=\"全书结构\">全书结构</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 知识图谱基础</strong>：核心概念、知识表示范式、本体设计——建立形式化基础。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 知识图谱构建</strong>：实体抽取、关系抽取、知识融合——从非结构化数据自动建图。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 知识图谱推理</strong>：图嵌入、KG 嵌入、规则推理、神经推理、神经符号——从已知推未知。</li>\n<li><strong>第四章 知识图谱应用</strong>：增强搜索、增强 LLM、领域实践、KGQA、推荐——把图谱变成产品价值。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"kg-fundamentals","title":"知识图谱基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"kg-concepts","title":"知识图谱基本概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-fundamentals/kg-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"knowledge-representation","title":"知识表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-fundamentals/knowledge-representation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ontology-design","title":"本体设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-fundamentals/ontology-design"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"kg-construction","title":"知识图谱构建","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-construction","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"entity-extraction","title":"实体抽取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-construction/entity-extraction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"relation-extraction","title":"关系抽取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-construction/relation-extraction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"knowledge-fusion","title":"知识融合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-construction/knowledge-fusion"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"kg-reasoning","title":"知识图谱推理","docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-reasoning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graph-embedding","title":"图嵌入方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-reasoning/graph-embedding"},{"seq":2,"slug":"kg-embedding","title":"知识图谱嵌入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-reasoning/kg-embedding"},{"seq":3,"slug":"kg-question-answering","title":"知识图谱问答","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-reasoning/kg-question-answering"},{"seq":4,"slug":"kg-reasoning","title":"知识图谱推理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-reasoning/kg-reasoning"},{"seq":5,"slug":"rule-based-reasoning","title":"基于规则的推理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-reasoning/rule-based-reasoning"},{"seq":6,"slug":"neural-reasoning","title":"神经网络推理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-reasoning/neural-reasoning"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"kg-applications","title":"知识图谱应用","docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"kg-enhanced-search","title":"知识图谱增强搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-applications/kg-enhanced-search"},{"seq":2,"slug":"kg-enhanced-llm","title":"知识图谱增强 LLM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-applications/kg-enhanced-llm"},{"seq":3,"slug":"domain-kg-practice","title":"领域知识图谱实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-applications/domain-kg-practice"},{"seq":4,"slug":"kg-qa-systems","title":"知识图谱问答系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-applications/kg-qa-systems"},{"seq":5,"slug":"kg-recommendation","title":"知识图谱增强推荐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-applications/kg-recommendation"},{"seq":6,"slug":"kg-search-augmentation","title":"知识图谱搜索增强","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-applications/kg-search-augmentation"}]}]}